rue[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H```[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8[2T[1;36r[2;1HBefore:[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1HI added `runAsUser: 65532` under `runAsNonRoot: true` in six templates: `backend.yaml`, `gateway.yaml`, `worker.yaml`, `reporter.yaml`, `metrics.yaml` and `migrate-jo(B[0;7m>[2;108H(B[m[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H**Fix:**[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8[2T[1;36r[2;1HThe Helm templates set `runAsNonRoot: true` but did not set a numeric user ID. The image's user is the name `nonroot`, which is UID `65532`. Kubernetes needs a number(B[0;7m>[2;108H(B[m[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8[2T[1;36r[3;1H**Cause:**[A[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H```[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1HError: container has runAsNonRoot and image has non-numeric user (nonroot), cannot verify user is non-root[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H```[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1HAfter deploying the lab, I ran `kubectl -n debug-lab get pods`. All app pods and the migrate Job were stuck in `CreateContainerConfigError`. The events showed this er(B[0;7m>[2;108H(B[m[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H**Symptom:**[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8[2T[1;36r[2;1H[36m## Defect 2[39m(B[m[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H---[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H5. Confirmed the change with `grep -n restartPolicy broken-chart/templates/migrate-job.yaml`.[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8[2T[1;36r[2;1H3. Ran `cat -n broken-chart/templates/migrate-job.yaml` to see the file with line numbers.[3d4. Found the wrong value on line 16 and changed it from `Always` to `Never`.[2;91H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H2. Read the error message, which named `restartPolicy` and listed the valid values.[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H1. Ran `./scenario.sh up` and got the migrate Job error.[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;34r8M[1;36r[2;1H**How I found it:**[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1HI chose `Never` because each retry creates a new pod, instead of restarting the same container. The number of retries is controlled by `backoffLimit`.[2;108H[?12l[?25h[?25l7[2;33r8M[1;36r[2;1H[?12l[?25h[?25l[34d(B[0;7mSave modified buffer?                                                                                                                                                  [35;1H Y(B[m Yes[K[36d(B[0;7m N(B[m No  [36;18H(B[0;7mC(B[m Cancel[K[34;23H[?12l[?25h[?25l[35d(B[0;7m^G(B[m Get Help[35;42H(B[0;7mM-D(B[m DOS Format[35;83H(B[0;7mM-A(B[m Append[35;124H(B[0;7mM-B(B[m Backup File[36d(B[0;7m^C(B[m Cancel[17G         [36;42H(B[0;7mM-M(B[m Mac Format[36;83H(B[0;7mM-P(B[m Prepend[36;124H(B[0;7m^T(B[m To Files[34d(B[0;7mFile Name to Write: FINDINGS.md(B[m[34;32H[?12l[?25h[?25l[34;76H[1K (B[0;7m[ Writing... ](B[m[K[1;158H(B[0;7m        (B[m[34;75H(B[0;7m[ Wrote 140 lines ](B[m[J[36d[?12l[?25h[36;1H[?1049l[23;0;0t[?1l>[?2004l]0;bcapdevops@solvervsvr054: ~/eb-devops-takehome/lab[01;32mbcapdevops@solvervsvr054[00m:[01;34m~/eb-devops-takehome/lab[00m$ ll
