[1;36r[25;11H[?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l[K[?12l[?25h[?25l[24;34r[34;1H
[1;36r[33;1H**Fix:**[24d[?12l[?25h[?25l[24;34r[34;1H
[1;36r[23;13H[?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l [?12l[?25h[?25l[K[?12l[?25h[?25l[22;34r[34;1H
